        "text": "Selected Answer: D. D is the correct answer here because you can use an environment variable to control the Cloud Run concurrency flag an environment variable in gloud. gcloud run servcies update my-service --concurrency=$varname In the Cloud Run console In your service YAML Example YAML snippet: yaml apiVersion: serving.knative.dev/v1 kind: Service metadata: name: my-service spec: template: spec: containerConcurrency: 80"
