        "text": "Answer is b, explanation: If you do not want any unavailable machines during an update, set the maxUnavailable value to 0 and the maxSurge value to greater than 0.With these settings, Compute Engine removes each old machine only after its replacement new machine is created and running. Ref: https://cloud.google.com/compute/docs/instance-groups/rolling-out-updates-to-managed-instance-groups"
